# --- Claude Code (plan review + implement) ----------------------------------
# Optional Claude Code overrides for the "Run plan review" and "Implement plan"
# buttons. When CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR is unset, the app looks for a profile
# containing the plan-review skill in ~/.claude, ~/.claude-one, or ~/.claude-two.
# CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=~/.claude
# CLAUDE_BIN=~/.local/bin/claude

# Note: the app's port (4823) is set in package.json scripts (`next dev -p 4823`),
# not here — Next.js does not read PORT from .env files for the dev server.
